# LOMBARD STAIRS: down the brick stairs on the crooked block's south sidewalk, an ollie off the top of the
# steep flight (east of the long treads) and down it, 1.1 s in the air, about 11 steps (1.9 m) below.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport -198 704.3 5.95 82
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x 4.95
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 0.74
hold ollie 112..142
run 400
expect event pop within 141..145
expect event gap{id=lombard_stairs,gap=LOMBARD STAIRS,points=600} within 280..284
expect event land{quality=clean} within 280..284
expect no event bail
